Package: okular-mupdf-ng
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, okular
Recommends: tesseract-ocr-eng
Description: MuPDF backend for Okular with an isolated document worker
 A backend for Okular that supports PDF, EPUB, and legacy MOBI documents.
 Document parsing, rendering, and OCR run in a separate sandboxed worker.
 The package includes mupdfng-cli and a statically linked, pinned MuPDF engine
 with the project's compatibility fixes.
